    "title_en": "Buzano type inequalities with applications",
    "abstract_en": "In this paper, we present new inner product inequalities that can be viewed as Cauchy-Schwarz-type or Buzano-type inequalities. We then apply these inequalities to derive applications for the numerical radius and the Euclidean operator radius of two operators. The obtained results are compared with many existing results in the literature in a way that supports the advantage of the new findings.",
